    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Witch's Dungeon is a small pixel top-down shooter game, you will be played as a witch and advanced through the dungeon!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Chouka, woke up in an unknown dungeon when she heard a mysterious woman's voice guiding her to escape. She doesn\u2019t remember how she got here, she just think it\u2019s a hassle and just want to get it over with.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manual\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD - Move Left click/Space bar\u00a0 Attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lshift - Switch weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc - Open menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Holding left click will let player keep attacking in that direction without changing direction so you can keep attacking while you dodging</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are in knocked down stage repeatedly click WASD to escape before the bar filled\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If lust gauge fills you will no longer be able to resist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E - Use magic beam</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However you will lose hp when you use this spell.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need these weapon to progress to the next map by breaking the door using weapon that dropped from the boss Ero Scene with the monster After you are defeated or caught by the monster the ero scene will be played!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Voice CG fully voiced by \u5922\u4e43\u3061\u304b\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Witch's Dungeon is a small pixel top-down shooter game, you will be played as a witch and advanced through the dungeon!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Chouka, woke up in an unknown dungeon when she heard a mysterious woman's voice guiding her to escape. She doesn\u2019t remember how she got here, she just think it\u2019s a hassle and just want to get it over with.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manual\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD - Move Left click/Space bar\u00a0 Attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lshift - Switch weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc - Open menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Holding left click will let player keep attacking in that direction without changing direction so you can keep attacking while you dodging</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are in knocked down stage repeatedly click WASD to escape before the bar filled\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If lust gauge fills you will no longer be able to resist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E - Use magic beam</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However you will lose hp when you use this spell.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need these weapon to progress to the next map by breaking the door using weapon that dropped from the boss Ero Scene with the monster After you are defeated or caught by the monster the ero scene will be played!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Voice CG fully voiced by \u5922\u4e43\u3061\u304b\u00a0</p>",
